              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bal. 21.1-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Omusaayi salenyaalutia khulwe khutiila khu mundu omufu tawe, ngeba aaba raraawe namwe maawe, omwana wewe omusoleeli namwe omukhaana, namwe wandaaye omukhaana osiili khucha mwilia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma we khutila khu mufu, alaliinda chindaalo saba, oli chaweele aba nono alaba omukwalaafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khu ndaalo niyo achila abuundu atakatifu, mu luuya lwe mukari khukhola kimilimo kio mwami, alaana siianwa siewe sie bumayaanu. Omwami WELE alomaloome.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
